    <fr:title text="Subgroups">Subgroups</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>
Let <fr:tex display="inline">G</fr:tex> be a group and <fr:tex display="inline">H</fr:tex> be a nonempty subset of <fr:tex display="inline">G</fr:tex> which is closed under operation <fr:tex display="inline">\times </fr:tex> and :
<html:ul><html:li><fr:tex display="inline">\forall  a,b\in  H,a\times  b\in  H</fr:tex></html:li>
<html:li><fr:tex display="inline">\forall  h\in  H,h^{-1}\in  H</fr:tex></html:li></html:ul>
then <fr:tex display="inline">H</fr:tex> is a subgroup of <fr:tex display="inline">G</fr:tex>. <fr:tex display="inline">e=h\times  h^{-1}</fr:tex> is always in group <fr:tex display="inline">H</fr:tex></html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
